PR & $-125$ to $-75$ & $-136$ to $-62$ & 0.0037 & 0.00216 \\
QRS & $-50$ to $25$ & $-62$ to $36$ & 0.0232 & 0.00086 \\
ST & $50$ to $125$ & $38$ to $136$ & 0.0081 & 0.00157 \\
T & $150$ to $375$ & $138$ to $386$ & 0.0053 & 0.00127 \\
